---
description: Zhihu write-path / account mutate constraints
globs: src/mutate/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# zhvault mutate

- Non-GET Zhihu HTTP (`request_json` POST/DELETE/PUT/PATCH) only from `src/mutate/`.
- Live writes only via CLI `account apply` with `--i-understand-danger` and `--confirm APPLY`.
- `account plan` is read/analyze only (no writes).
- Do not auto-apply after `backup` / `resume`.
- Prefer throttled client; continue on per-item failure with `failed[]` in summary.
